

~ start
if GameManager.current_time == GameManager.TimeOfDay.EARLY_MORNING
	You've got some free time. What would you like to do?
	- Study 
		$> GameManager.study_score += 1
		You study what you can. Maybe you understood. Maybe you don't.
	- Sleep in
		You tuck yourself back in on this cold morning.
		$> GameManager.rest += 25

elif GameManager.current_time == GameManager.TimeOfDay.MORNING
	You've got some free time. What would you like to do?
	- Shower
		$> GameManager.hygiene += 85
		You take a nice shower.
	- Eat
		$> GameManager.hunger += 40
		You have a nice, hearty breakfast.
	- Go Out
		No one's up this early. You go out alone.
		$> GameManager.happiness += 1
	- Study 
		$> GameManager.study_score += 1
		You feel like you learned more than if you had gone to lecture.
	- Sleep in
		You sleep even more tightly knowing your friends are going to lecture.
		$> GameManager.rest += 30
	
elif GameManager.current_time == GameManager.TimeOfDay.LUNCH
	You've got some free time. What would you like to do?
	- Shower
		$> GameManager.hygiene += 85
		You take a nice shower.
	- Study 
		$> GameManager.study_score += 3
		You feel like you learned more than if you had gone to lecture.
	- Sleep in
		You go home and have a nap.
		$> GameManager.rest += 25

elif GameManager.current_time == GameManager.TimeOfDay.AFTERNOON
	You've got some free time. What would you like to do?
	- Shower
		$> GameManager.hygiene += 85
		You take a nice shower.
	- Study 
		$> GameManager.study_score += 2
		You feel like you learned more than if you had gone to lecture.
	- Go Out
		You go out with some friends.
		$> GameManager.happiness += 1
		$> GameManager.social_score += 3
	- Eat
		$> GameManager.hunger += 30
		You have lunch.
	- Sleep
		You sleep in on such a fine day and wake up feeling even worse.
		$> GameManager.rest -= 5
	

elif GameManager.current_time == GameManager.TimeOfDay.EVENING
	You've got some free time. What would you like to do?
	- Shower
		$> GameManager.hygiene += 85
		You take a nice shower.
	- Study 
		$> GameManager.study_score += 2
		You study until the sun sets.
	- Go Out
		You go out with some friends.
		$> GameManager.happiness += 1
		$> GameManager.social_score += 3
	- Sleep
		$> GameManager.rest += 30
		$> GameManager.advance_time_slot()
		You lie in bed, and wake back up in the middle of the night. Maybe that wasn't such a good idea. 
	- Eat
		$> GameManager.hunger += 40
		You have an early dinner.

elif GameManager.current_time == GameManager.TimeOfDay.NIGHT
	You've got some free time. What would you like to do?
	- Shower
		$> GameManager.hygiene += 75
		You take a nice shower.
	- Study 
		$> GameManager.study_score += 1
		You studied but can't really recall understanding anything.
	- Go Out
		You go out with some friends.
		$> GameManager.happiness += 1
		$> GameManager.social_score += 3
	- Eat
		$> GameManager.hunger += 40
		You eat dinner.

elif GameManager.current_time == GameManager.TimeOfDay.LATE_NIGHT
	You've got some free time. What would you like to do?
	- Study 
		$> GameManager.study_score += 1
		You pull an all nighter.
	- Go Out
		You pull up the late owl squad, and get up to some shenanigans.
		$> GameManager.happiness += 3
		$> GameManager.social_score += 3


$> GameManager.advance_time_slot()
=> END

~ set_time
# Time Management Debug / Selection Menu
Select the time of day you want to jump to:
- Early Morning
	$> GameManager.set_time_slot(GameManager.TimeOfDay.EARLY_MORNING)
	=> start
- Morning
	$> GameManager.set_time_slot(GameManager.TimeOfDay.MORNING)
	=> start
- Lunch
	$> GameManager.set_time_slot(GameManager.TimeOfDay.LUNCH)
	=> start
- Afternoon
	$> GameManager.set_time_slot(GameManager.TimeOfDay.AFTERNOON)
	=> start
- Evening
	$> GameManager.set_time_slot(GameManager.TimeOfDay.EVENING)
	=> start
- Night
	$> GameManager.set_time_slot(GameManager.TimeOfDay.NIGHT)
	=> start
- Late Night
	$> GameManager.set_time_slot(GameManager.TimeOfDay.LATE_NIGHT)
	=> start